<title>USA: Rockford Park Dist., Ill., won by Banc One.</title>
<headline>Rockford Park Dist., Ill., won by Banc One.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banc One Capital Corp said it won $5.050 million of Rockford Park District, Ill., general obligation limited tax park bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.3122 percent.</p>
</text>
